ker</strong> \u2013 Reveals the role of fallen players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional</strong> \u2013 Can kill without leaving a body behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copycat</strong> \u2013 Appears like a killer but is actually innocent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlaw</strong> \u2013 Innocent but can use weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more</strong> \u2013 Each character adds variety and strategy to every match.</p></li></ul>","developers":[" 7hgamestudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957720/a014187d4766e9d66bfc23b392b10d1bff00a679/header.jpg?t=1758017899","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257197772,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197772/movie480.mp4?t=1757966353","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197772/movie_max.mp4?t=1757966353"},"name":"Grim Pastures Outlaw - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197772/1c86c42fc5f56a8bf89f0f12241c97918ea51a76/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757966353","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197772/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757966353","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197772/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757966353"}}],"name":"Grim Pastures: Outlaws","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6300 / Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 580<br></l